{"overview":"ماجراهای آنه بونشوی ۱۳ ساله و خودمحور که به طور جادویی به دنیای خیالی آمفیبیا منتقل می‌شود، باتلاقی روستایی پر از جمعیتی قورباغه. با کمک یک قورباغه جوان جوگیر به نام اسپریگ، آنه به یک قهرمان تبدیل می‌شود و اولین دوستی واقعی زندگی خود را کشف می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The adventures of 13-year-old, self-centered Anne Boonchuy who is magically transported to the fictitious world of Amphibia, a rural marshland full of frog-people. With the help of an excitable young frog named Sprig, Anne will become a hero and discover the first true friendship of her life.","tagline_en":"Life’s never boring when you’re amphibious.","runtime":11,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل ۱","ep":39,"y":2019,"poster":"/zYhdu8J58U3dfGpguEY2EiNMcG3.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل ۲","ep":36,"y":2020,"poster":"/4eQizSNtiXLCBFyWiRivjaSw52j.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل ۳","ep":31,"y":2021,"poster":"/im8s0W4RlGRziILHjzzSDCfeMO4.jpg"}],"episodes":106,"crew":["Matt Braly"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Brenda Song","role":"Anne Boonchuy (voice)","photo":"/eyYiNWXquotE53lfjsgcwxgfvu.jpg"},{"name":"Justin Felbinger","role":"Sprig Plantar (voice)","photo":"/7qY0El4GT6MTb0xVzC5pQwcN2JU.jpg"},{"name":"Amanda Leighton","role":"Polly Plantar (voice)","photo":"/h5d07tlCEt7PYSDYYXpzfpwb62M.jpg"},{"name":"Bill Farmer","role":"Hopediah Plantar (voice)","photo":"/lhezx68R12s5Bsv7d77BrQb7tWA.jpg"},{"name":"On Braly","role":"Mrs. Boonchuy (voice)","photo":""},{"name":"Brian Sounalath","role":"Mr. Boonchuy (voice)","photo":"/2QkZZ7CRjXZgcganOKMaLGbhVX6.jpg"}],"trailer":"dfYAb84mnZg","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/85349-amphibia/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Disney Plus","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/5eZ872CghnHFLB1j8grszbrx0dx.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"},{"n":"Google Play Movies","kind":"buy","logo":"/aZRENwYILujqs0RVOZutTh0BVGV.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/85349-amphibia/watch?l